  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">C&#xF4;te d&apos;Ivoire - Responsible Global Supply Chains</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Inades Foundation is the local implementation partner. Outcome 1: Inades Foundation is better equipped to support cashew
farmers, their organisations and processing units; Outcome 2: Farmers professionalise the management of their farms
while respecting the environment and the requirements of the international market;Outcome 3: Workers, in particular female workers, at the small and medium-sized cashew nut processing units taking part in the project, enjoy decent work and job security</narrative>
  </description>
